This project is an unofficial, community-built packaging of BentoPDF
(https://github.com/alam00000/bentopdf, AGPL-3.0-only, (C) its authors).
It is not affiliated with or endorsed by the BentoPDF project. Upstream
source is fetched at build time and is not copied into this repository;
all upstream copyright and license notices are preserved in that source.

Third-party components that may appear in built artifacts (each retains its
own license; verify versions in the upstream lockfile at build time):
  - BentoPDF ................ AGPL-3.0
  - PyMuPDF ................. AGPL-3.0
  - Ghostscript ............. AGPL-3.0
  - CoherentPDF (CPDF) ...... AGPL-3.0 per upstream README (verify at release)
  - Tesseract.js / tessdata . Apache-2.0
  - LibreOffice (WASM) ...... via @matbee/libreoffice-converter; license UNVERIFIED
  - bentopdf-pdfium, bentopdf-viewer (vendor/ tarballs) ... license UNVERIFIED
  - Electron ................ MIT
  - Capacitor ............... MIT

Explicitly excluded: hyper-compress-wasm and Kura (separately licensed by the
BentoPDF authors; not redistributed here). Upstream imports hyper-compress-wasm
in compress.ts, so excluding it requires a patch (see docs/ROADMAP.md, M1).

No release artifact ships until every UNVERIFIED line above is resolved.

Corresponding source for any distributed artifact is this repository at the
matching tag plus the pinned upstream BentoPDF tag recorded in UPSTREAM_VERSION.
